Design Disclaimer

The visual layout of this portfolio — a dark, card-based home screen with
a horizontal project carousel — is independently inspired by the general
look of the PlayStation 5 console's dashboard. It was chosen because it
reads as clean, professional, and practical for presenting a list of
projects, and because building it was itself a way to demonstrate front-end
web development and UI/UX skills.

This project is an independent work and is not affiliated with, endorsed
by, sponsored by, or otherwise connected to Sony Interactive Entertainment
LLC or any of its affiliates. "PlayStation" and "PS5" are trademarks of
Sony Interactive Entertainment LLC and are used here only to describe the
source of the visual inspiration. No official Sony/PlayStation logos,
trademarks, fonts, UI assets, or other copyrighted material are used
anywhere in this project — every asset under assets/ and every line of
code is original work by the author.
